+# CookiePartitionKey Object
+
+* `topLevelSite` string (optional) - The site of the top-level frame the partition belongs to, e.g.
+  `https://example.com`.
+* `hasCrossSiteAncestor` boolean (optional) - Whether the cookie was set in a frame with a cross-site ancestor.
+  When setting or looking up a cookie, defaults to whether its URL is cross-site to `topLevelSite`.
